# determinism.kps's march and fight: the files at fixed ticks; the marines sent north-east (the camera put there first:
# the mission's triggers move it) take the long way round the cliffs and fight by the east edge, framed at the end.
mark ordered
wait tick >= @ordered.tick + 120
state march
shot march
camera 1250 290
wait frames 2
rclick world 1290 280
wait tick >= @ordered.tick + 330
log path tick units:1 camera.x camera.y
state path
shot path
wait tick >= @ordered.tick + 900
camera 1850 870
wait frames 2
log fight tick units:1 units:2 units:4
state fight
shot fight
